  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned to further empower your spells by using a ravel of their associated magical school or sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ability to weave ravels, casting class feature or ability to cast spells, caster level 5.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you cast a spell or magic sphere effect by unweaving a ravel, if that spell’s school or magic sphere effect’s sphere matches the ravel’s associated school or sphere the caster level of that spell or magic sphere effect is increased by +1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/raveler-class#toc60\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
